  <item>
    <title>vol.26 对谈|命理师告诉我，玄学不是一切的解药</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65609683f10bbce63518a67f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65609683f10bbce63518a67f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Nov 2023 12:26:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本单口真心话节目第一次邀请嘉宾，职业命理师斯年，录播客的过程中，又欢乐又感动，让我对人力以外的部分，有了不一样的视角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对玄学好奇，希望也能给你多一个选项~本播客没有任何价值引导，嘉宾斯年特别提醒，玄学水深，注意甄别，小心上当受骗啊朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾@斯年命卜，7年职业命理师，道门弟子。公众号@斯年命卜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播@蝴蝶，心理咨询师，蝴蝶心理减肥法创始人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 本期节目来源：心理咨询师和命理师的“互相救赎”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 能不能大白话讲讲，玄学到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 所谓“天道”，是什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 普通人的人生，辅天道而行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 蝴蝶算命盘，我的人生竟然是明牌！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 做这么多年命理师的感受，众生众态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 命盘是在帮助我们成全本性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 卜卦是不是智商税？谁喜欢谁多也能算吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 好运的人躺平还能一直好运吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 玄学不是一切的解药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 低谷期就是要把自己的底子攒得厚厚的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 好风水就是好气场，居家好风水的3个小小方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 命理师告诉我，没有所谓正缘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> &nbsp;从玄学走向哲学，从体验到“认识你自己”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">1:01:10</a> 养生也要辅天道，干净的食物自带能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">1:07:30</a> 玄学故事会，开讲了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4450">1:14:10</a> 死亡也许是另一个开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">1:20:30</a> 经常梦到某个人，也没啥</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切好运都是福报换来的~</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65228e860432a3157817882b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65228e860432a3157817882b"><span>心理减肥创业，在自己身上，克服这个时代</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c"><span>裸辞4次，创业2次，25岁我才知道自己是谁</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5"><span>真正的成长，是重新养育自己</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg_3OMeASkblSYQPPaZK9g5-fyGt.m4a" length="31085788" type="audio/mp4"/>
