  <item>
    <title>vol.25 心理减肥创业，在自己身上，克服这个时代</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65228e860432a3157817882b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65228e860432a3157817882b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Oct 2023 11:12:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来跟各位云股东汇报工作，本播客诞生的创业项目，现在怎么样了呢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸡血满满的一期，需要充电的朋友速听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 一个完全从播客里诞生的创业项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 【心理减肥】不是职业规划，而是从我的生命体验里长出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 抑郁伴随焦虑，节食混合暴食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 很久之后我才知道，我【情绪性进食】了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 自由职业到创业，走过怎样的身份认同之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 用三个词形容蝴蝶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 超有贵人缘的蝴蝶哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 不配得感反复袭来？你配吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 躺平一点也快乐，因为你躺不平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3285">54:45</a> 找到一条路，把力气用完</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 找合作伙伴，及发福利环节~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客提到的内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>蝴蝶和@佳莹的播客对谈~</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6520108619dde7bf6a1015a1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6520108619dde7bf6a1015a1"><span>《进化人生》：读懂情绪性进食和脂肪增长的内心戏，减肥不必那么苦</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6423e930179eec5331a2cd9b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6423e930179eec5331a2cd9b"><span>@闪光少女斯斯：《给女孩的商业第一课》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c"><span>裸辞4次，创业2次，25岁我才知道自己是谁</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5"><span>真正的成长，是重新养育自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>内耗是全天下最不值得的事</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhwouFmA3JUK6KgYbHz9R3r_7Ipf.m4a" length="59521221" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:16</itunes:duration>
