  <item>
    <title>vol.24 每一次拒绝，都为了成为自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ea4b910d7e8eaa728bea7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ea4b910d7e8eaa728bea7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Feb 2023 14:39:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好久不见！汇报一下近况，有个巨大的机会，和一个严肃的拒绝。本创业小白，好慌张哈哈哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 非常非常非常奇妙的听友相遇！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 做人不要太拖延</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 被一个巨大的机会冲懵了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 你想做一个100w用户的平台吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 他人眼中的自己，还是我想要的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">23:47</a> 拒绝让我知道我是谁，选择让我知道我是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 不是每次都要做更困难的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 改变的恐惧，大于不改变的痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 找到喜欢的事也超焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 欢迎听众朋友多多反馈~感谢能量的流动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">41:39</a> 学会通马桶，才是女孩的成人礼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 也是拒绝过100w的人了，牛逼</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6288d24183ddae2d9e72a88c"><span>裸辞4次，创业2次，25岁我才知道自己是谁</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63510ff42a992d56e91e62c5"><span>真正的成长，是重新养育自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>内耗是全天下最不值得的事</span></a></p>]]></description>
