  <item>
    <title>vol.23 脱口秀大会总决赛的这天，我去听张博洋的线下啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637758477105b234344c09d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637758477105b234344c09d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Nov 2022 10:02:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好，欢迎收听我的电子日记！</span></p><span></span><p><span>脱口秀大会总决赛播出的晚上，我去听了张博洋的线下。张博洋的洞察当然精确又幽默，但更打动我的的，是不藏拙，敢于露怯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在周围人都激流勇进的时刻，一退再退（阴阳怪气）。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 很羞耻，我买了黄牛票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 线下脱口秀和线上超级不一样（内含张博洋吐槽）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 地铁口的烤红薯真好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 抗糖饮食势在必行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 最近多多少少有变活泼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 胡乱分享三个状态好转的原因（对冬天里每一个感觉好的时刻感恩戴德）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 譬如昨日死，譬如今日生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 开始进行一些纯享乐型消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 一个精品店的东亚经典小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>（结尾加音乐了嘿嘿嘿，不会剪辑博主浅浅后期一下）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvaM55cuxWywsgsgktZwuRP0F1Ba.m4a" length="36325619" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtADoXQjnM7QsL4ewNtr02hEeVot.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.22 我很紧张，但没关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636c84c9a5004aa3aa5710fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636c84c9a5004aa3aa5710fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Nov 2022 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感到紧张也没关系，无法拒绝也没关系，害怕也没关系，羞涩也没关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是我模式的一部分，和理想中不一样也没关系。</span></p>]]></description>
