  <item>
    <title>vol.20 裸辞4次，创业2次，25岁我才知道自己是谁（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6288d25b5cf4a5ad60ca088d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6288d25b5cf4a5ad60ca088d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 May 2022 11:51:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 再次失去工作，不知道自己要做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 隐藏的情绪原来这么多年没有释放过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 谢谢播客，谢谢你们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 决定去上海，休息一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a> 两个月胖了17斤，omg</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 我要做一个心理咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 再做个赚钱美女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 副业要慎重朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 改变是真的可以发生的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> 回答一下蝴蝶是做什么的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号欢迎订阅：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DFE1nG3G8vztnqITE9o6zg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DFE1nG3G8vztnqITE9o6zg"><span>裸辞4次，创业2次，25岁我才知道自己是谁</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于100人通话计划】</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟100个陌生人通话，我想不带预判地跟你聊聊天，如果你有故事想讲，有困惑想聊，或者单纯想开启一段猫滚键盘的闲聊，都欢迎光临，微信联系我吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>内耗是全天下最不值得的事</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b2121c895990fbfb7629df?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1Z