  <item>
    <title>vol.18 所有想当好孩子的你，我们试试做个坏人吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6271122b3e8abf901a68d992</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6271122b3e8abf901a68d992</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2022 11:29:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你当好孩子当得累不累？只做对的事，不做自己想做的事，像教科书一样标准和无聊，我曾经就是这样。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 每天做一点坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 在选城市的时候，离开“过敏源”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 拥有自己的房间，建立自己的秩序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 不要在友谊里委屈自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 我不是工具，我是人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 放下圣母心，会游泳也救不了溺水的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 每天做一件拒绝的小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 如何拒绝别人，如何建立边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 和这个世界，不断相互筛选</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>百人通话倒计时19个，社恐友友准备好了吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>---------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于100人通话计划】</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟100个陌生人通话，我想不带预判地跟你聊聊天，如果你有故事想讲，有困惑想聊，或者单纯想开启一段猫滚键盘的闲聊，都欢迎光临，微信联系我吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>内耗是全天下最不值得的事</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b2121c895990fbfb7629df?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b2121c895990fbfb7629df?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>迷茫和孤独，我们是怎样成为自己的</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6118f845629a774bd842e6e7?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6118f845629a774bd842e6e7?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>成为恋爱脑不是你的错</span></a></p>]]></description>
