  <item>
    <title>vol.17 时隔四个月，我又开始心理咨询了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6266913352e1ee5135199431</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6266913352e1ee5135199431</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Apr 2022 12:16:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔四个月我又开始心理咨询了，再一次咨询的心情又很不一样。在地面的时候不觉得绳子有多重要，漂浮在水上的时候，握住咨询的绳子，像是握住什么稳定的安全。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 多年的努力，隔离一个月反弹一半</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 我不哭是因为我没纸巾擦眼泪！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 第一次做咨询的时候我在想什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 辛苦考到90分的我，不想再回到30分了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 我不是每一次都有勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 我无法顺畅地表达需要和伤心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 感恩每次勇敢都有正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 第二次咨询的新课题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 谢谢接住我的好朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 你被无条件的爱，是在谁那里</span></p><span></span><p><span>本周预告：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>新的环境下，我们怎样选择城市呢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>和陌生人通话，我在想什么</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>---------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于伸出圆手】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“用拯救过我的，去拯救其他人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里可以暴露脆弱，练习接纳，分享成长，希望和你一起，建立一个安全放松的房间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于100人通话计划】</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟100个陌生人通话，我想不带预判地跟你聊聊天，如果你有故事想讲，有困惑想聊，或者单纯想开启一段猫滚键盘的闲聊，都欢迎光临，微信联系我吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期节目推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6141dff6739ee43cac33a5b9?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>内耗是全天下最不值得的事</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b2121c895990fbfb7629df?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b2121c895990fbfb7629df?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>迷茫和孤独，我们是怎样成为自己的</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6118f845629a774bd842e6e7?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6118f845629a774bd842e6e7?s=eyJ1IjoiNjE5Njk2YjllMGY1ZTcyM2JiNzUwYzhmIn0%3D"><span>成为恋爱脑不是你的错</span></a></p>]]></description>
